-- ===========================================================================
-- Warlock (Affliction): NEW talent -- Malfeasance
-- ===========================================================================
--
-- TODO.md: "Below that, in the next tier and with a requirement to have
--           'Fel Interdiction', should be a new talent called 'Malfeasance':
--           'Damage from Drain Life, Shadow Bolt and Haunt has a 10/20%
--           chance to clear a stack of Mark of Gul'dan'."
--
-- Fel Interdiction (woa_2026_08_06_01.sql) can only be cleared by channelling
-- Drain Soul, which costs the whole global rotation.  Malfeasance lets the
-- normal Affliction rotation chip at the stack instead, so the talent pair
-- reads as "defer damage, then earn it back by keeping up your damage".
--
-- Spells:
--   200521 = Malfeasance Rank 1 (10%)
--   200522 = Malfeasance Rank 2 (20%)
-- Talent: NEW ID 3004 (3000 and 3003 are taken), Affliction (TabID 302),
--         Tier 8 Col 3 -- directly below Fel Interdiction at Tier 7 Col 3 --
--         gated on talent 1668 rank 1.
-- ===========================================================================


